*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : FRD0004
*> PURPOSE : FRAUD SCORING RULES
*> AUTHOR  : A.W.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1987-08-18 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-12-06 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 360
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB FRDNIGHT STEP090
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FRD0004.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-IN-REC.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 CUST-AGE           PIC 9(3).
    *> TRANSACTION AMOUNT
    05 TXN-AMOUNT         PIC 9(7)V99.
    *> ORIGIN COUNTRY CODE
    05 CNTRY-CODE         PIC X(2).
    05 POST-DATE          PIC 9(8).
    05 POST-DATE-R REDEFINES POST-DATE.
       10 POST-DATE-YYYY  PIC 9(4).
       10 POST-DATE-MM    PIC 9(2).
       10 POST-DATE-DD    PIC 9(2).
    05 FILLER             PIC X(2).
01 WS-RESULTS.
    05 FLAG-REVIEW        PIC X VALUE 'N'.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT WS-IN-REC
    PERFORM MINOR-TXN-CHECK
    DISPLAY "FLAG-REVIEW=" FLAG-REVIEW
    STOP RUN.
MINOR-TXN-CHECK.
    *> HIGH-VALUE TRANSACTION BY MINOR
    IF CUST-AGE < 16 AND TXN-AMOUNT > 7500
        MOVE 'Y' TO FLAG-REVIEW
    END-IF.
